# Ratchet for scripts/check_tests_ssot.py's state round-trip rule.
#
# One serializable object per line (its `<p>_set_state` prefix), each with a
# reason, whose C test does not yet call DP_STATE_ROUNDTRIP_TEST.
#
# THIS LIST MAY ONLY SHRINK. The shared round trip is where the state
# standard's claims are checked -- fidelity, the envelope reject, and that
# get_state writes EVERY byte of the blob (doppler#1471: acq's hand-written
# round trips never saw its unwritten ring tail). A new serializable object
# goes under the macro; it does not go on this list.
#
# An entry that is now covered, or no longer serializable, is a FAILURE: the
# list went stale. Burn-down: doppler#1475.
